---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';

const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, '');
const repo = 'https://github.com/nanbo0ne/O.R.C.A-for-Windows';
const R2 = 'https://orca.aichat.diy/releases/desktop-v3.0.4';

const goVer = '3.0.4';
---
<Base
  title="Docs — O.R.C.A"
  titleEn="Docs — O.R.C.A"
  titleZh="文档 — O.R.C.A"
  description="O.R.C.A setup, providers, Vision attachments, workspaces, tools, and permissions in 3.0.4. Managed local AI and Computer Use remain temporarily disabled on all platforms; code and configuration are retained.">

  <header class="nav scrolled">
    <div class="nav-inner">
      <a class="brand" href={`${base}/`}><img src={`${base}/logo.svg`} alt="O.R.C.A logo" /><span>O.R.C.A</span></a>
      <nav class="nav-links">
        <a href={`${base}/#features`}><span class="l-en">Features</span><span class="l-zh">特性</span></a>
        <a href={`${base}/#how`}><span class="l-en">How it works</span><span class="l-zh">工作原理</span></a>
        <a href={`${base}/#community`}><span class="l-en">Community</span><span class="l-zh">社区</span></a>
        <a href={`${base}/docs/`} class="here"><span class="l-en">Docs</span><span class="l-zh">文档</span></a>
        <a href={`${base}/#start`}><span class="l-en">Get started</span><span class="l-zh">快速开始</span></a>
      </nav>
      <div class="lang-switch" role="group" aria-label="Language">
        <button type="button" data-lang="en" class="active">EN</button>
        <button type="button" data-lang="zh">中文</button>
      </div>
      <a class="btn btn-dark" href={`${base}/#start`}><span class="l-en">Install</span><span class="l-zh">安装</span></a>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main class="docs-layout">
    <aside class="docs-side">
      <div class="side-group">
        <span class="gh"><span class="l-en">Getting started</span><span class="l-zh">快速开始</span></span>
        <a href="#install"><span class="l-en">Installation</span><span class="l-zh">安装</span></a>
        <a href="#quickstart"><span class="l-en">Quick start</span><span class="l-zh">快速上手</span></a>
        <a href="#config"><span class="l-en">Configuration</span><span class="l-zh">配置</span></a>
      </div>
      <div class="side-group">
        <span class="gh"><span class="l-en">Concepts</span><span class="l-zh">核心概念</span></span>
        <a href="#cache"><span class="l-en">Prefix cache</span><span class="l-zh">前缀缓存</span></a>
        <a href="#permissions"><span class="l-en">Permissions &amp; sandbox</span><span class="l-zh">权限与沙箱</span></a>
        <a href="#mcp"><span class="l-en">Plugins (MCP)</span><span class="l-zh">插件(MCP)</span></a>
      </div>
      <div class="side-group">
        <span class="gh"><span class="l-en">Reference</span><span class="l-zh">参考</span></span>
        <a href="#cli"><span class="l-en">CLI &amp; slash commands</span><span class="l-zh">命令行与斜杠命令</span></a>
        <a href="#configfile"><span class="l-en">Config file</span><span class="l-zh">配置文件</span></a>
      </div>
    </aside>

    <article class="docs-main">
      <h1><span class="l-en">Documentation</span><span class="l-zh">文档</span></h1>
      <h2><span class="l-en">3.0.4</span><span class="l-zh">3.0.4</span></h2>
      <p><span class="l-en">3.0.4 focuses first run on DeepSeek, with Flash for text and Vision for unconfigured visual work. Explicit roles and custom providers remain. Managed local AI is temporarily disabled without deleting files; external compatible local services remain usable. Computer Use stays disabled. See the <a href={`${repo}/blob/main/docs/audits/2026-09-08-v3.0.4-release-validation.md`}>validation report</a> for DPI and remaining test scope.</span><span class="l-zh">3.0.4 首次配置聚焦 DeepSeek，文本默认 Flash，未设置的视觉任务默认 Vision；明确配置的角色与自定义供应商保留。托管本地 AI 暂时禁用但不删除文件，外部兼容本地服务仍可使用。电脑操控继续禁用。DPI 与其余测试范围见<a href={`${repo}/blob/main/docs/audits/2026-09-08-v3.0.4-release-validation.md`}>验证报告</a>。</span></p>
      <p><span class="l-en">Stage replies stream between tool groups. Compact/Detailed controls provider reasoning only; final answers stay outside completed summaries, which show elapsed time, tokens, and known official DeepSeek cost. Turn navigation is on the left, Todo floats above the Composer without a full-width backdrop, and the fixed sidebar entry is ORCA Agent.</span><span class="l-zh">阶段性回复在工具组之间流式显示。简略/详细仅控制供应商 reasoning；最终答案保持独立，完成摘要显示耗时、token 及可确认的 DeepSeek 官方费用。回合定位移至左侧，Todo 浮于输入框上方且无全宽底色，固定侧栏入口为 ORCA Agent。</span></p>
      <p><span class="l-en">Generated images require read/send permissions and a validated snapshot before visual delegation. Downloads show source, speed, and ETA; cancel before switching to another source for the same signed file. Speed depends on the actual route. Future builds omit old-brand duplicates; existing releases are retained. Full product documentation: <a href={`${repo}/blob/main/README.en.md`}>English README</a>.</span><span class="l-zh">生成图片经读取/发送权限与快照校验后才能委派识图。下载显示来源、速度与 ETA；先取消，再切换同一签名文件的来源。实际速度取决于网络。下一版不再生成旧品牌副本，历史发布保留。完整产品介绍见<a href={`${repo}/blob/main/README.md`}>中文 README</a>。</span></p>
      <p><span class="l-en">DeepSeek official pricing checked on 2026-09-08: CNY per million tokens. Peak time is fixed at UTC+8 Monday-Friday 09:00-12:00 and 14:00-18:00; other times are off-peak. Each request freezes pricing at start. Amounts already stored for 3.0.3 remain USD and are not back-converted or relabeled. A session containing USD and CNY turns is not shown as one authoritative total; each turn keeps its own currency. Source: <a href="https://api-docs.deepseek.com/zh-cn/quick_start/pricing/">official pricing page</a>.</span><span class="l-zh">DeepSeek 官方价格于 2026-09-08 核对，单位为 CNY/百万 token。峰时固定为 UTC+8 周一至周五 09:00-12:00、14:00-18:00，其余为闲时；每次请求开始时冻结计价依据。3.0.3 已存金额保留 USD，不回算人民币、不改标签。包含 USD 与 CNY 回合的会话不显示为一个权威总额，各回合保留自己的币种。来源：<a href="https://api-docs.deepseek.com/zh-cn/quick_start/pricing/">官方价格页</a>。</span></p>
      <table>
        <thead><tr><th><span class="l-en">Model and period</span><span class="l-zh">模型与时段</span></th><th><span class="l-en">Cache-hit input</span><span class="l-zh">缓存命中输入</span></th><th><span class="l-en">Cache-miss input</span><span class="l-zh">未命中输入</span></th><th><span class="l-en">Output</span><span class="l-zh">输出</span></th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr><td>Flash / Vision <span class="l-en">off-peak</span><span class="l-zh">闲时</span></td><td>¥0.05</td><td>¥1.5</td><td>¥4.5</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Flash / Vision <span class="l-en">peak</span><span class="l-zh">峰时</span></td><td>¥0.10</td><td>¥3</td><td>¥9</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Pro <span class="l-en">off-peak</span><span class="l-zh">闲时</span></td><td>¥0.15</td><td>¥4.5</td><td>¥13.5</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Pro <span class="l-en">peak</span><span class="l-zh">峰时</span></td><td>¥0.30</td><td>¥9</td><td>¥27</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
      <h2><span class="l-en">Published 3.0.3 baseline</span><span class="l-zh">已发布的 3.0.3 参考</span></h2>
      <p class="lede"><span class="l-en">Everything you need to install O.R.C.A, start your first session, and understand why long sessions stay cheap. For the full engineering contract, see the <a href={`${repo}/blob/main-v2/docs/SPEC.md`}>Spec</a> and <a href={`${repo}/blob/main-v2/docs/GUIDE.md`}>Guide</a> on GitHub.</span><span class="l-zh">从安装到第一次会话,以及理解为什么长会话依然便宜——你需要的都在这里。完整工程契约见 GitHub 上的 <a href={`${repo}/blob/main-v2/docs/SPEC.md`}>Spec</a> 与 <a href={`${repo}/blob/main-v2/docs/GUIDE.md`}>Guide</a>。</span></p>

      <p><span class="l-en"><strong>Computer Use is temporarily disabled on all platforms in 3.0.3.</strong> Windows, macOS, and Linux register no computer-control tools, capture no screens, and send no native mouse or keyboard input. Code and configuration remain for restoration after later validation. Existing consent, Full access, bots, and automation cannot enable it. Ordinary attachments and default Vision image analysis remain supported.</span><span class="l-zh"><strong>3.0.3 所有平台暂时禁用电脑操控。</strong>Windows、macOS、Linux 均不注册电脑工具、不截图、不执行原生鼠标键盘输入。代码和配置保留，待后续验收后恢复；已有授权、Full access、机器人和自动化均不能开启。普通附件与默认 Vision 识图仍支持。</span></p>

      <h2 id="install"><span class="l-en">Installation</span><span class="l-zh">安装</span></h2>
      <p><span class="l-en">One command on macOS, Linux, Windows, or WSL.</span><span class="l-zh">一条命令,支持 macOS、Linux、Windows 或 WSL。</span></p>
      <div class="codeblock"><button data-copy="npm i -g orca-agent">Copy</button><span class="c"># npm (recommended · 推荐)</span>
npm i -g orca-agent

<span class="c"># Homebrew</span>
brew install nanbo0ne/O.R.C.A-for-Windows/orca-agent</div>
      <div class="callout"><span class="ico">!</span><span><span class="l-en">Use the <a href={`${repo}/releases/tag/desktop-v${goVer}`}>Release page assets</a> for v{goVer} downloads and verification files. Users on older versions need one manual installation. Back up configuration and sessions before upgrading.</span><span class="l-zh">v{goVer} 下载与校验文件以 <a href={`${repo}/releases/tag/desktop-v${goVer}`}>Release 页资产</a>为准。旧版本用户需手动安装一次，升级前备份配置和会话。</span></span></div>
      <p><span class="l-en">Prefer a GUI? Desktop apps for macOS, Windows, and Linux are on the <a href={`${base}/#start`}>download page</a>.</span><span class="l-zh">想用图形界面?macOS、Windows、Linux 桌面端请前往<a href={`${base}/#start`}>下载页</a>。</span></p>

      <h2 id="quickstart"><span class="l-en">Quick start</span><span class="l-zh">快速上手</span></h2>
      <p><span class="l-en">First run is minimal — <code>orca setup</code> walks you through picking a provider, local model, or skip path. Then point O.R.C.A at a repo and start a session:</span><span class="l-zh">首次运行很简单——<code>orca setup</code> 引导你选择云端供应商、本地模型或稍后设置。然后指向仓库、开始会话:</span></p>
      <div class="codeblock"><button data-copy="cd your-project && orca code">Copy</button>cd your-project
orca code</div>
      <p><span class="l-en">Then just describe the task:</span><span class="l-zh">然后直接描述任务:</span></p>
      <div class="codeblock"><span class="a">›</span> add retry with backoff to the http client
<span class="a">›</span> refactor the auth flow, keep the public API stable
<span class="a">›</span> why is the worker leaking memory?</div>
      <p><span class="l-en">In the desktop app, you can also attach an image you choose and ask, "Extract the table as CSV," or attach a document for a summary. These tasks use ordinary attachments and do not start Computer Use.</span><span class="l-zh">桌面端也可手动附上图片并提问“提取表格并整理成 CSV”，或附上文档要求摘要。这些任务使用普通附件，不会启动电脑操控。</span></p>
      <p><span class="l-en">Leave the session running — context is append-only, so every new turn starts from a cache hit instead of a cold start.</span><span class="l-zh">让会话一直跑着——上下文只追加,每一轮都从缓存命中开始,而不是冷启动。</span></p>

      <h2 id="config"><span class="l-en">Configuration</span><span class="l-zh">配置</span></h2>
      <p><span class="l-en">O.R.C.A connects to the provider you choose with your own API key. Secrets come from the environment via <code>api_key_env</code> and are never written to config files:</span><span class="l-zh">O.R.C.A 使用你自己的 API Key 连接所选供应商。密钥通过 <code>api_key_env</code> 从环境读取,绝不写入配置文件:</span></p>
      <div class="codeblock"><button data-copy="export DEEPSEEK_API_KEY=sk-...">Copy</button>export DEEPSEEK_API_KEY=sk-...</div>
      <p><span class="l-en">Your code goes to your machine and the model — nowhere else. Persistent options live in the <a href="#configfile">config file</a>.</span><span class="l-zh">你的代码只会经过你的机器与模型,不去任何别处。持久化选项见<a href="#configfile">配置文件</a>。</span></p>
      <p><span class="l-en">An unconfigured Vision role defaults to the official <code>deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash-vision-exp</code>. Explicit role choices and text-subagent defaults are preserved; no API key is bundled. Saved Computer Use roles and their defaults remain in configuration but do not run in 3.0.3.</span><span class="l-zh">未配置的 Vision 角色默认候选为官方 <code>deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash-vision-exp</code>。显式角色和文本 subagent 默认值保留，包内不提供 API key；Computer Use 角色及其默认值仍保存在配置中，但在 3.0.3 中不运行。</span></p>

      <h2 id="cache"><span class="l-en">Prefix cache</span><span class="l-zh">前缀缓存</span></h2>
      <p><span class="l-en">DeepSeek bills cached prefix tokens at a fraction of fresh computation. Most agents waste this: they reorder messages, rewrite summaries mid-session, or inject volatile timestamps — every change invalidates the cache from that point on.</span><span class="l-zh">DeepSeek 对缓存前缀 token 的计费远低于新计算。多数智能体浪费了这一点:重排消息、会话中改写摘要、注入易变的时间戳——任何改动都会让其后的缓存全部失效。</span></p>
      <p><span class="l-en">O.R.C.A serializes context deterministically and only ever appends. The practical effect: hours-long sessions where 90%+ of every request replays from cache, and input-token cost collapses to ~1/5. See the <a href={`${base}/#how`}>animated walkthrough</a> on the home page.</span><span class="l-zh">O.R.C.A 以确定性方式序列化上下文,并且永远只追加。实际效果:数小时的会话中每次请求 90% 以上从缓存重放,输入 token 成本降到约 1/5。可在首页查看<a href={`${base}/#how`}>动态演示</a>。</span></p>

      <h2 id="permissions"><span class="l-en">Permissions &amp; sandbox</span><span class="l-zh">权限与沙箱</span></h2>
          <p><span class="l-en">Permissions gate each tool call: <code>deny</code> &gt; <code>ask</code> &gt; <code>allow</code> &gt; fallback. Readers always allow; writers fall back to <code>[permissions] mode</code>. <code>orca chat</code> prompts before each writer; <code>orca run</code> stays autonomous but still honours <code>deny</code>.</span><span class="l-zh">权限逐个把关工具调用:<code>deny</code> &gt; <code>ask</code> &gt; <code>allow</code> &gt; 兜底。读工具始终放行;写工具回退到 <code>[permissions] mode</code>。<code>orca chat</code> 在每次写操作前询问;<code>orca run</code> 自主运行,但仍遵守 <code>deny</code>。</span></p>
      <p><span class="l-en">The sandbox is enforcement: file-writers refuse any path outside <code>[sandbox] workspace_root</code> (default: the current dir), resolving symlinks and <code>..</code> so a link can't tunnel out. Reads are unrestricted.</span><span class="l-zh">沙箱负责强制执行:写文件工具拒绝 <code>[sandbox] workspace_root</code>(默认当前目录)之外的任何路径,并解析符号链接与 <code>..</code>,防止借链接逃逸。读取不受限。</span></p>

      <h2 id="mcp"><span class="l-en">Plugins (MCP)</span><span class="l-zh">插件(MCP)</span></h2>
      <p><span class="l-en">O.R.C.A is an MCP client. A <code>[[plugins]]</code> entry's <code>type</code> selects the transport — <code>stdio</code> (default) launches a local subprocess, <code>http</code> connects to a remote <code>url</code>. Tools surface to the model as <code>mcp__&lt;server&gt;__&lt;tool&gt;</code>. Already have an <code>.mcp.json</code>? Drop it in the project root and O.R.C.A reads it as-is.</span><span class="l-zh">O.R.C.A 是一个 MCP 客户端。<code>[[plugins]]</code> 条目的 <code>type</code> 选择传输方式——<code>stdio</code>(默认)启动本地子进程,<code>http</code> 连接远程 <code>url</code>。工具以 <code>mcp__&lt;server&gt;__&lt;tool&gt;</code> 呈现给模型。已有 <code>.mcp.json</code>?放到项目根目录,O.R.C.A 会原样读取。</span></p>
      <div class="codeblock"><span class="c"># orca.toml</span>
[[plugins]]                       <span class="c"># local stdio server</span>
name    = "example"
command = "orca-plugin-example"

[[plugins]]                       <span class="c"># remote server over Streamable HTTP</span>
name    = "stripe"
type    = "http"
url     = "https://mcp.stripe.com"
headers = &#123; Authorization = "Bearer $&#123;STRIPE_KEY&#125;" &#125;</div>

      <h2 id="cli"><span class="l-en">CLI &amp; slash commands</span><span class="l-zh">命令行与斜杠命令</span></h2>
      <div class="codeblock">orca setup            <span class="c"># first-run: cloud, local, or skip</span>
orca code             <span class="c"># start an interactive session in the current repo</span>
orca chat             <span class="c"># interactive session, prompts before writes</span>
orca run "&lt;task&gt;"     <span class="c"># autonomous run, honours deny rules</span></div>
      <p><span class="l-en">Inside a session, slash commands run locally — <code>/help</code> lists them all:</span><span class="l-zh">会话中,斜杠命令在本地运行——<code>/help</code> 列出全部:</span></p>
      <div class="codeblock">/compact   /new      /rewind   /tree     /branch
/switch    /todo     /model    /mcp      /skills
/hooks     /memory   /language /output-style       /help</div>
      <p><span class="l-en"><code>/branch [name]</code> forks the current conversation tip, <code>/switch &lt;id|name&gt;</code> loads another branch. Custom commands are Markdown files under <code>.orca/commands/</code>.</span><span class="l-zh"><code>/branch [name]</code> 从当前会话尖端分叉,<code>/switch &lt;id|name&gt;</code> 加载另一条分支。自定义命令是 <code>.orca/commands/</code> 下的 Markdown 文件。</span></p>

      <h2 id="configfile"><span class="l-en">Config file</span><span class="l-zh">配置文件</span></h2>
      <p><span class="l-en">Resolution order: flag &gt; <code>./orca.toml</code> &gt; <code>~/.config/orca/config.toml</code> &gt; built-in defaults.</span><span class="l-zh">解析顺序:flag &gt; <code>./orca.toml</code> &gt; <code>~/.config/orca/config.toml</code> &gt; 内置默认值。</span></p>
      <div class="codeblock"><span class="c"># ~/.config/orca/config.toml</span>
default_model = "deepseek-flash"

[agent]
auto_plan = "ask"                  <span class="c"># off|ask|on</span>

[[providers]]
name        = "deepseek-flash"
kind        = "openai"
base_url    = "https://api.deepseek.com"
model       = "deepseek-v4-flash"
api_key_env = "DEEPSEEK_API_KEY"

[permissions]
mode  = "ask"                                <span class="c"># ask|allow|deny</span>
deny  = ["bash(rm -rf*)", "bash(git push*)"]
allow = ["bash(go test*)"]</div>
      <p><span class="l-en">For the full schema and every field's contract, see <a href={`${repo}/blob/main-v2/docs/SPEC.md`}>SPEC.md §5</a>.</span><span class="l-zh">完整 schema 与每个字段的契约见 <a href={`${repo}/blob/main-v2/docs/SPEC.md`}>SPEC.md §5</a>。</span></p>

      <div class="doc-cards">
        <a class="doc-card" href={`${base}/#how`}>
          <h3><span class="l-en">See the cache in action →</span><span class="l-zh">看缓存如何工作 →</span></h3>
          <p><span class="l-en">Scroll-driven walkthrough of prefix replay on the home page.</span><span class="l-zh">首页的滚动演示:前缀重放的每一轮。</span></p>
        </a>
        <a class="doc-card" href={repo}>
          <h3><span class="l-en">Contribute →</span><span class="l-zh">参与贡献 →</span></h3>
          <p><span class="l-en">O.R.C.A is MIT-licensed and open source — good first issues are waiting.</span><span class="l-zh">O.R.C.A 采用 MIT 许可、开源——新手友好任务等着你。</span></p>
        </a>
      </div>
    </article>
  </main>

  <footer>
    <div class="foot-inner">
      <a class="brand" href={`${base}/`}><img src={`${base}/logo.svg`} alt="O.R.C.A logo" /><span>O.R.C.A</span></a>
      <span><span class="l-en">© 2026 O.R.C.A · MIT licensed · built to be left running.</span><span class="l-zh">© 2026 O.R.C.A · MIT 许可 · 为常驻运行而生。</span></span>
      <nav class="foot-links">
        <a href={repo}>GitHub</a>
        <a href={`${base}/docs/`}><span class="l-en">Docs</span><span class="l-zh">文档</span></a>
        <a href={`${base}/#start`}><span class="l-en">Install</span><span class="l-zh">安装</span></a>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </footer>
</Base>
